[installEventFilter](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qobject.html#installEventFilter)(),
[timerEvent](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qobject.html#timerEvent)(),
[QCoreApplication::sendEvent](https://doc.qt.io/archives/qt-5.15/qcoreapplication.html#sendEvent)(),
and
